Dolt is a versioned SQL database and CLI ("Git for data").

Runtime dependency used by the dolt binary:
  glibc

Build dependencies for this package:
  go >= 1.25.6
  gcc (cgo toolchain)
  git (module fetch fallback for VCS sources)

Build notes from upstream source scan:
  Upstream README builds from source with:
    go install ./cmd/dolt
  Upstream go/go.mod requires:
    go 1.25.6
  Upstream README notes cgo is required, so a working C compiler
  and toolchain must be present during build.
  This SLKBUILD uses equivalent go build arguments with distro
  hardening flags and outputs /usr/bin/dolt.
  Go caches are redirected to the source tree so builds do not fail
  when /run/user tmpfs cache space is constrained.
  Network access is required during build to fetch Go modules.
